WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.299 --> 00:00:06.649
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie.

00:00:06.649 --> 00:00:09.599
Here’s part two of my Doctor Who 50th Anniversary
easter eggs.

00:00:09.599 --> 00:00:13.559
I thought it would be fun to try and find
all the hidden references in the 50th anniversary

00:00:13.559 --> 00:00:16.199
but there were so many I had to break it into
two parts.

00:00:16.199 --> 00:00:18.400
This part will just cover everything in the
second half of the broadcast.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.230
I think in total I did about 33 or 34 easter
eggs in the first video.

00:00:20.230 --> 00:00:22.390
So let’s see if we can top that without
making an hour long video.

00:00:22.390 --> 00:00:25.211
Also, I’m getting lots of Christmas Special
questions about Peter Capaldi being the 14th

00:00:25.211 --> 00:00:26.211
Doctor or even the valeyard.

00:00:26.211 --> 00:00:28.281
I’m going to do a video about that next
week.

00:00:28.281 --> 00:00:31.159
Be sure to subscribe to get it.

00:00:31.159 --> 00:00:32.159
Let the easter egg hunt begin.

00:00:32.159 --> 00:00:35.690
If you’re following along these are in chronological
order of appearance starting right after the

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:38.329
first appearance of captain jack’s vortex
manipulator.

00:00:38.329 --> 00:00:41.039
Starting things off, The Vortex Manipulator
code.

00:00:41.039 --> 00:00:46.650
Matt Smith carves into the wall is actually
the date and time the very first episode of

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:47.650
doctor who aired.

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:48.650
The Painting.

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:50.920
Because Matt Smith’s doctor called from
the past for the security guard to move the

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:53.920
painting before present day clara entered
the black archive.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:56.019
It’s already there when she first arrives.

00:00:56.019 --> 00:00:58.789
The Oldest Operating System In the universe.

00:00:58.789 --> 00:01:02.289
The sonic screwdrivers are used to open the
door in the tower of London.

00:01:02.289 --> 00:01:06.560
This works because each doctor regenerates
and gets a new sonic, but the software inside

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:08.290
each sonic is the same.

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:12.430
Meaning you could start running a program
and it would continue to run through each

00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:13.430
regeneration.

00:01:13.430 --> 00:01:14.430
That would be like buying a new computer every
couple of years but still running it on MS-DOS.

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:17.330
Making SonicOS the oldest operating system
in the universe.

00:01:17.330 --> 00:01:19.760
Next to the operating system of the moment.

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:21.000
How Old is the Doctor.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.520
Matt Smith answers that he’s about 1200
years old.

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:24.610
Unless I’m lying.

00:01:24.610 --> 00:01:27.850
Rule number one is the doctor lies, but he
also forgets things.

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:31.960
Steven Moffat also said in a recent interview
that the doctor doesn’t know which number

00:01:31.960 --> 00:01:33.420
regeneration he is.

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:37.750
So while audiences know him as 11, he could
actually be a higher number.

00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:39.130
You’ve met them before.

00:01:39.130 --> 00:01:43.100
Matt Smith reminds clara that she’s met
every version of the doctor thanks to jumping

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:46.200
into his time stream during the events of
The name of the doctor.

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:50.490
She’d only be able to remember that she
met them if the doctor was able to re-integrate

00:01:50.490 --> 00:01:52.000
all of the versions of clara when he also
went into his own time stream to rescue her.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:53.000
She dodges the question, so we don’t get
confirmation.

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:54.000
Meaning she could just be a different version
of the original clara.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:55.000
Cuppa Soup.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.000
The Doctor refers to the stasis cube as a
cuppa soup.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.000
Why?

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.000
Because it’s bachelor food.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:03.860
And as advanced as the doctor is, he’s very
lonely and eats lonely depressing bachelor

00:02:03.860 --> 00:02:04.860
food.

00:02:04.860 --> 00:02:05.860
Like Cuppa soups.

00:02:05.860 --> 00:02:06.860
Does this happen a lot.

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:09.580
The Doctor gets kissed a lot, but which doctor
gets the most face time?

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:16.000
Just speaking about the new doctors, number
9 got kissed twice, number 10 got kissed 9

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:19.380
times and number 11 has gotten kissed 8 times
so far.

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:22.421
Making David Tennant the snogging champion
pending any kissy moments in the christmas

00:02:22.421 --> 00:02:23.421
special.

00:02:23.421 --> 00:02:24.421
I’ll be right back.

00:02:24.421 --> 00:02:25.421
Number 10 didn’t see Elizabeth again until
the events of The Elizabeth Code.

00:02:25.421 --> 00:02:26.421
Which might be why she wants to chop his head
off.

00:02:26.421 --> 00:02:27.421
Matt Smith’s doctor also says the exact
same thing to a young Amelia Pond before returning

00:02:27.421 --> 00:02:28.421
12 years late.

00:02:28.421 --> 00:02:29.421
And it also kind of looks like she wants to
chop his head off for a little while.

00:02:29.421 --> 00:02:30.421
Back to the future.

00:02:30.421 --> 00:02:31.421
This is a nice reference to the Back to the
future franchise.

00:02:31.421 --> 00:02:32.421
I don’t think Michael J Fox was on set that
day.

00:02:32.421 --> 00:02:33.421
The round things.

00:02:33.421 --> 00:02:35.360
These are a reference to the classic doctor’s
tardises.

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:37.990
Starting with william hartnell up to the 8th
doctor’s tardis.

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:41.560
Each interior had a similar version of the
‘round things’ on the walls.

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:42.960
You’ve redecorated.

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:46.840
Tennant’s doctor says this, and it’s the
same thing the second doctor said during the

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:49.480
three doctor’s 10th anniversary special.

00:02:49.480 --> 00:02:53.120
Matt Smith also says it to Craig in Closing
Time during series 6.

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:55.190
The humans don’t realize what half this
stuff does.

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:56.440
In case you missed them.

00:02:56.440 --> 00:03:02.341
These are river song’s red shoes from The
Time of The Angels.

00:03:02.341 --> 00:03:03.341
Magna Clamps.

00:03:03.341 --> 00:03:07.260
These are torchwood’s magna clamps first
seen in Army of Ghosts and then later in Doomsday.

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:14.830
The cancel an objects mass, making large objects
easy to lift.

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:16.360
The spacetime telegraph.

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:19.840
This was like the classic version of the doctor’s
phone number that the fourth doctor gave to

00:03:19.840 --> 00:03:21.070
brigadier general.

00:03:21.070 --> 00:03:25.690
He first used it to summon the doctor during
revenge of the cybermen and later terror of

00:03:25.690 --> 00:03:26.690
the zygons.

00:03:26.690 --> 00:03:27.710
The doctor’s phone number.

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:31.790
This is the same phone number the doctor has
had since Stolen earth in series 4.

00:03:31.790 --> 00:03:33.150
The big red button.

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:36.349
This flower like button is an homage to Rose
Tyler.

00:03:36.349 --> 00:03:40.319
Because although billie piper is in the special
she’s not playing Rose or Bad Wolf.

00:03:40.319 --> 00:03:42.000
The sound of the tardis.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:45.500
The Moment tells John hurt that the sound
means hope to all who hear it.

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:49.200
But River Song let us know that the tardis
isn’t actually supposed to make that sound.

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:51.959
The Doctor has just been doing it wrong ever
since he stole it.

00:03:51.959 --> 00:03:53.120
Or it stole him.

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.470
For my next trick.

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:58.700
During the final montage when all 13 doctor’s
are on screen in order to make the scene work.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:02.599
The production team used stock footage from
the previous doctors, including Christopher

00:04:02.599 --> 00:04:04.510
Eccleston, who declined to participate in
the episode.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:06.080
Had he said yes his part would probably have
been expanded from this quick moment.

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:07.080
All 13.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:11.830
Peter Capaldi is credited by the high council
as a doctor in a very brief cameo, but he’s

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:14.130
not listed as a doctor in the the credits.

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:17.430
We know Matt Smith will regenerate in the
christmas special, but we don’t know how

00:04:17.430 --> 00:04:20.900
Steven Moffat is going to deal with the 13
regenerations limit.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.740
I hope the ears are a bit less conspicuous
this time.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:27.669
This is a joke about christopher eccleston,
who’s ears stick out from his head a lot.

00:04:27.669 --> 00:04:32.099
The special effects team even morphs john
hurt’s face just a little to look like eccleston’s

00:04:32.099 --> 00:04:33.099
during the regeneration.

00:04:33.099 --> 00:04:34.099
I don’t want to go.

00:04:34.099 --> 00:04:38.319
This is a reference to David Tennant’s final
words before regenerating into the 11th doctor.

00:04:38.319 --> 00:04:41.139
Matt Smith responds with “He always says
that..”

00:04:41.139 --> 00:04:42.169
The Great curator.

00:04:42.169 --> 00:04:44.099
Tom Baker makes his illustrious appearance.

00:04:44.099 --> 00:04:48.060
In the background on the wall are circles
resembling his tardis and he even tells the

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:52.620
11th doctor the secret of the painting and
that the doctor might find himself revisiting

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:54.430
old favorite faces in the future.

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:58.499
This implies that the doctor eventually finds
a way past his regeneration limit and since

00:04:58.499 --> 00:05:02.599
we already know regenerations can be controlled
he could totally be a future version of the

00:05:02.599 --> 00:05:06.569
doctor that regenerated into a similar version
of his fourth self.

00:05:06.569 --> 00:05:10.540
It also opens the door to the classic doctors
appearing on the show in the future.

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:14.249
So be sure to write any other extra references
you caught in the comments.

00:05:14.249 --> 00:05:15.759
Remember this video is just the second half
of the special.

00:05:15.759 --> 00:05:20.309
All the stuff from the first half is in my
part 1 video.

